1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,705
The devices to quote.

2
00:00:01,705 --> 00:00:08,450
Understatement: they could not understand a word he said, so flat that the kindness feels enormous.

3
00:00:08,450 --> 00:00:10,104
Irony in the last line.

4
00:00:10,104 --> 00:00:16,132
Sensory imagery, sunsets and wood smoke, instead of named feelings.

5
00:00:16,132 --> 00:00:19,361
Lists, including a list of mixed feelings.

6
00:00:19,361 --> 00:00:22,877
Symbols: the fence, the lumber, the garden.

7
00:00:22,877 --> 00:00:26,640
And a motif of sound that runs from shouting to a cheer.

